### Control plane
Properties within the `.controlPlane` top-level object

| **Property** | **Description** | **More Details** |
| :----------- | :-------------- | :--------------- |
| `controlPlane.diskSizeGB` | **Disk size (GB)** - Size of the disk attached to the node.|**Type:** `integer`<br/>**Example:** `50`<br/>**Default:** `100`|
| `controlPlane.volume` | **Volume** - A volume attached to a node.|**Type:** `object`<br/>|
| `controlPlane.volume.label` | **Label** - Label of the filesystem on the volume.|**Type:** `string`<br/>|

### Workers
Properties within the `.workers` top-level object

| **Property** | **Description** | **More Details** |
| :----------- | :-------------- | :--------------- |
| `workers.diskSizeGB` | **Disk size (GB)** - Size of the disk attached to the worker node. Worker nodes hold the container images, so this is larger than on the control plane.|**Type:** `integer`<br/>**Example:** `50`<br/>**Default:** `100`|
| `workers.spareDiskSizeGB` | **Spare disk size (GB)** - Size of the second disk attached to the worker node.|**Type:** `integer`<br/>**Examples:** `300`, `400`<br/>**Default:** `200`|
| `workers.volume` | **Volume** - A volume attached to a worker node.|**Type:** `object`<br/>|
| `workers.volume.label` | **Label** - Label of the filesystem on the volume.|**Type:** `string`<br/>|
